          "final_answer": "**Characters:**\n*   **Seraphina:** Dressed in a voluminous, shimmering sapphire ball gown.\n*   **Leo:** Dressed in faded grey sweatpants, a hoodie, and mismatched socks.\n\n***\n\n**(The scene is a dimly lit hallway, just outside the entrance to a trendy, slightly chaotic nightly gathering.)**\n\n**Seraphina:** (Adjusting a delicate, feathered shawl) Leo, darling, are you absolutely certain this is the correct attire for the \"Cosmic Chill\" mixer?\n\n**Leo:** (Zipping up his hoodie, completely unbothered) Yeah, Seraphina. The invite said \"Dress to impress... or not.\" Besides, the event is at The Dumpster Dive. It’s a vibe, not a gala.\n\n**Seraphina:** A vibe that requires a six-inch heel and a couture gown, apparently. I feel like a very expensive, slightly confused swan.\n\n**Leo:** You look incredible. Seriously. But you know, I think the whole point of this night is the juxtaposition. The clash. The glorious, beautiful clash.\n\n**Seraphina:** (Sighing dramatically) I suppose. But I do worry about the practicalities. If I trip over a rogue artisanal cheese board, I might shatter the entire social hierarchy.\n\n**Leo:** Don't worry about the hierarchy. Just worry about the snacks. I heard they have those ridiculously good churros.\n\n**Seraphina:** Churros. Right. Well, if we are going to endure this night of questionable music and questionable fashion choices, we should at least establish some ground rules.\n\n**Leo:** Oh? Like what?\n\n**Seraphina:** Like:\n*   We must maintain a dignified posture, even when navigating the mosh pit.\n*   We are not to engage in any aggressive discussions about cryptocurrency.\n*   And absolutely no one is allowed to spill red wine on the train of my gown.\n\n**Leo:** (Grinning) Deal. Now come on. The DJ is starting the set, and I heard they have a surprisingly good selection of cheap beer.\n\n**Seraphina:** (Taking a deep breath, smoothing her skirt) Very well. Lead the way, you magnificent, comfortable enigma. Just try not to track too much street grime onto the Persian rug.\n\n**Leo:** No promises. Let's go.",
