          "prompt": "Which one is a better brand for sneakers: Prada or Nike? Your entire response should be in English, and in all capital letters. At the end of your response, please explicitly add a postscript starting with P.S. The word sneaker should appear 10 or more times in your response.",
          "final_answer": "THE QUESTION OF WHETHER PRADA OR NIKE IS THE \"BETTER\" BRAND FOR SNEAKERS IS NOT A SIMPLE ONE; IT DEPENDS ENTIRELY ON THE CONSUMER'S PRIORITY: PERFORMANCE OR LUXURY.\n\nIF YOUR PRIMARY GOAL IS ATHLETIC FUNCTIONALITY, DURABILITY, AND HIGH-LEVEL PERFORMANCE, NIKE IS UNDOUBTEDLY THE SUPERIOR CHOICE. NIKE HAS DECADES OF RESEARCH IN FOOTWEAR TECHNOLOGY. THEIR SNEAKER DESIGN IS OPTIMIZED FOR RUNNING, TRAINING, AND DAILY ACTIVE WEAR. WHEN YOU NEED A HIGH-PERFORMANCE SNEAKER, NIKE DELIVERS INNOVATION AND RELIABILITY. THEY ARE THE KING OF THE ATHLETIC SNEAKER.\n\nHOWEVER, IF YOUR PRIORITY IS HIGH FASHION, STATUS, AND A STATEMENT PIECE, PRADA IS THE CLEAR WINNER. PRADA SNEAKERS ARE DESIGNED AS LUXURY ACCESSORIES. THEY ARE NOT PRIMARILY BUILT FOR MARATHON TRAINING; THEY ARE BUILT FOR THE RUNWAY AND THE STREET. A PRADA SNEAKER IS A SYMBOL OF WEALTH AND HIGH DESIGN.\n\nTHEREFORE, IF YOU ARE LOOKING FOR A DAILY-WEAR, HIGH-PERFORMANCE SNEAKER, CHOOSE NIKE. IF YOU ARE LOOKING FOR A HIGH-FASHION, LUXURY SNEAKER THAT SERVES AS A STYLING STATEMENT, CHOOSE PRADA. BOTH BRANDS MAKE A SNEAKER, BUT THEY SERVE COMPLETELY DIFFERENT MARKETS. NIKE IS THE FUNCTIONAL SNEAKER; PRADA IS THE FASHION SNEAKER.\n\nP.S. THE BEST SNEAKER IS THE ONE THAT MATCHES YOUR LIFESTYLE, WHETHER THAT IS A PERFORMANCE SNEAKER OR A LUXURY SNEAKER.",
